cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "引用本项目时请带版本号；格式见 NOTICE.md 第 3 节。"
title: "Html九尾狐：人机共驾的 HTML 内容交付工作台"
abstract: >-
  HtmlNineFox is a local-first workbench for producing deliverable HTML:
  an infinite canvas of briefs, templates and files, an intake review desk
  with licence tiers, a page-decomposition channel, six artefact generators,
  revision history, and an export centre (PDF / PNG / PPTX / DOCX).
  AI is an optional upgrade, never a dependency — the offline rule engine
  still completes every path.
